The trains and the availability of MAX JEUNE and MAX SENIOR seats come from
the dataset "Disponibilité à 30 jours de places MAX JEUNE et MAX SENIOR
ouvertes à la réservation" of SNCF Voyageurs, on the open data portal of SNCF
(https://ressources.data.sncf.com/explore/dataset/tgvmax/), under the Open
Database License (ODbL 1.0): https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/.
The widgets show the source (SNCF open data) and the time of the data. The
files under test/fixtures are extracts of this database, kept under the same
licence.

